#* {{quote-book|en|author=Terry Dowling|authorlink=Terry Dowling|chapter=The Four Darks|editor={{w|Ellen Datlow}}|title=Fearful Symmetries: An Anthology of Horror|publisher=ChiZine Publications|year=2014|page=117|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/fearfulsymmetrie0000unse/page/117/mode/1up|isbn=978-1-77148-193-9|passage=Allan Grace was lean, but his neck '''muffined''' out over the crisp white collar.}}
